    "en": "Types and codes"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Paper, mica, ceramic, polyester and electrolytic capacitors differ in dielectric. Electrolytic capacitors give large values in a small size but are polarised: the + lead must go to the higher potential. Variable (gang) capacitors tune radios. A capacitor is specified by capacitance, working voltage and tolerance. Small capacitors use a code in picofarads: 104 means 10 × 10⁴ pF = 0.1 µF.",
    "kn": "ಕಾಗದ, ಮೈಕಾ, ಸೆರಾಮಿಕ್, ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ವಿಭಜ್ಯ ಧಾರಕಗಳು ಡೈಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಿಕ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಭಿನ್ನ. ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ವಿಭಜ್ಯ ಧಾರಕಕ್ಕೆ ಧ್ರುವೀಯತೆ ಇದೆ. ಸಂಕೇತ 104 = 0.1 µF."
